---
See and clean what holst keeps on this machine.

USAGE
  holst storage <command> [flags]

COMMANDS
  ls:          List what holst keeps on this machine, with sizes
  clean:       Remove old logins, partial files and stale copies

EXAMPLES
  $ holst storage ls
  $ holst storage clean -n
